From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 17:24:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] init: load Floral device identity profile

Read a strict, complete device.prop from the shared Floral instance
directory during boot property initialization. Invalid or absent profiles
fall back atomically to the built-in Floral identity.

Expose the selected GPU presentation strings as immutable boot properties
for the graphics libraries without changing rendering capabilities.

---
